Takeaway: generic configs sit near Poisson(2) with p_0~e^-2~0.135>0 (INDEPENDENCE => lonely);
additive chains force p_0=0 (CORRELATION kills the ground state). LRC = correlation can
empty the bulk p_0 but never the measure-0 witness set. The worry-set = the large-deviation residual.
